g=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Font TeamMeat l.png\" data-image-key=\"Font_TeamMeat_l.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Font_TeamMeat_l.png/revision/latest?cb=20210822060746\" /></span></span></span></div></div></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"99\" height=\"99\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Spikeball.png\" data-image-key=\"Spikeball.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7a/Spikeball.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826035343\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>852.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Corpse\" title=\"Corpse\"><img alt=\"Stage Corpse icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Corpse icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Corpse_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/30/Stage_Corpse_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172440\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Spikeballs</b> fly back and forth in a line either horizontally or vertically, bouncing off walls and obstacles. They will be destroyed once the room is cleared. However, if the room doesn't need clearing, they will remain permanently.\n</p><p>Spikeballs will be destroyed immediately upon entering a room while holding the <span class=\"tooltip\" data-tooltip=\"t/tooltip&#124;Flat+File&#124;8\"><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flat_File\" title=\"Flat File\"><img alt=\"Flat File\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trinket Flat File icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Trinket_Flat_File_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Trinket_Flat_File_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825164110\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flat_File\" title=\"Flat File\">Flat File</a></span>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h3><span id=\"Singe.27s_Ball\"></span><spa