-color\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity Image</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"infobox2-slideshow dlc-slideshow\"><div class=\"infobox2-slide\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Entity image\"><img alt=\"Entity image\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"78\" height=\"81\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Singe&#39;s Ball.png\" data-image-key=\"Singe%27s_Ball.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/eb/Singe%27s_Ball.png/revision/latest?cb=20210516072753\" /></span></span></div></div><br /></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>915.1</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\"><img alt=\"Stage Ashpit icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Ashpit icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Ashpit_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/cf/Stage_Ashpit_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172340\" /></a></span><br />Exclusively spawned in <a href=\"/wiki/Singe\" title=\"Singe\">Singe's</a> boss room.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Singe's Balls</b> are movable Spikeballs spawned during the <a href=\"/wiki/Singe\" title=\"Singe\">Singe</a> boss fight. They will not move on their own but can be pushed via touch, tears, and explosions- particularly Singe's. They deal half a heart of contact damage and are destroyed upon Singe's defeat.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Spikeball\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Spikeball\">Spikeball</a> first appeared in the <i>Antibirth</i> mod where it behaved similarly however it would not be destroyed and would continue moving after the room was cleared.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><img alt=\"MainPageAchievements\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"MainPageAchievements.png\" data-image-key=\"MainPageAchievements.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/26/MainPageAchievements.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20151124025857\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\">Achievements</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenges\" title=\"Challenges\"><img alt=\"MainPageChallenges\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"MainPageChallenges.png\" data-image-key=\"MainPageChallenges.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4b/MainPageChallenges.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20141129224206\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Challenges\" title=\"Challenges\">Challenges</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\